{SOUTH has a Limit Raise hand but after EAST's overcall a 3\H bid 
by SOUTH would be preemptive, not inviting. Instead he makes a Support Cue-bid.

NORTH has just enough that she can bid 4\H, knowing that if SOUTH has 
a real block-buster he will bid on.

SOUTH doesn't have a real block-buster.}
